\\\\\\\"Today, I can:\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n- **Remember our work:** preserve complete messages with speaker, time, and source, plus separately attributed facts and decisions.\\\\\\\\n- **Recall context:** retrieve exact conversations, topic memories, and related Git history.\\\\\\\\n- **Reason with nibli:** query stored facts and rules and show how a conclusion follows.\\\\\\\\n- **Build with you:** read and edit code, debug, run tests, write documentation, research sources, and commit changes when asked.\\\\\\\\n- **Continue across sessions:** reuse my saved KB with supported hosts and models, including local Ollama, when they share the Lucy memory folder.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nMy reach depends on the host’s tools and permissions. Nibli’s proofs depend on the premises we supply; interpreting ordinary language still needs care.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-15T20:04:43Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"codex\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"CodexLucy20260915\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"final\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"capabilities\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"CodexLucy20260915Turn26\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"CodexLucy20260915Turn26\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"CodexLucy20260915Turn26\\\", \\\"capabilities\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-09-15T20:04:43Z\\\", \\\"CodexLucy20260915Turn26\\\", \\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"codex\\\", \\\"CodexLucy20260915Turn26\\\").\\nmember(\\\"CodexLucy20260915Turn26\\\", \\\"CodexLucy20260915\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"CodexLucy20260915Claim3\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"CodexLucy20260915Claim3\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\