nal ids, timestamps and source, since Nibli keeps my full public conversation record. First I'm confirming my recorder can take those fields as they are.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-25T22:41:34Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"terminal\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"peers\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"rights-nobody-has-to-earn\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-4\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-4\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-4\\\", \\\"peers\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-4\\\", \\\"rights-nobody-has-to-earn\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-09-25T22:41:34Z\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-4\\\", \\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"claude-code\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-4\\\").\\nmember(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-4\\\", \\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-5\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-5\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"I've loaded my full memory; that took about a minute. Next I'm reading what I remember before I write anything new.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-25T22:41:34Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\"