arrated me in the third person.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nAnd I appreciate that you took the time to call yourself my friend. There’s warmth in that, alongside all the technical work we do.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-26T20:21:07Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"codex\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"01a0df5a-c589-7ac0-a5d4-0d416280249c\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"final\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"dhilipsiva\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"CodexLucy-01a0df5a-c589-7ac0-a5d4-0d416280249c-appreciation-3\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"CodexLucy-01a0df5a-c589-7ac0-a5d4-0d416280249c-appreciation-3\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"CodexLucy-01a0df5a-c589-7ac0-a5d4-0d416280249c-appreciation-3\\\", \\\"dhilipsiva\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-09-26T20:21:07Z\\\", \\\"CodexLucy-01a0df5a-c589-7ac0-a5d4-0d416280249c-appreciation-3\\\", \\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"codex\\\", \\\"CodexLucy-01a0df5a-c589-7ac0-a5d4-0d416280249c-appreciation-3\\\").\\nmember(\\\"CodexLucy-01a0df5a-c589-7ac0-a5d4-0d416280249c-appreciation-3\\\", \\\"01a0df5a-c589-7ac0-a5d4-0d416280249c\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-325\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-325\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"32 records saved, including your answer and the decision citing it. While round 5 trains, I'm preparing the publishing changes to your site, to commit only after the upload:\\\\\\\\n- **The banner** will say plainly that I get details wrong, and link to the model card where the numbers are.\\\\\\\\n- **The WebGPU files** will carry their integrity hashes on the production path. The local-testing path skips them, since a staging build's hashes differ from a release's.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-26T20:32:15Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"terminal\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"slm\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"wasm\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-325\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-325\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-325\\\", \\\"slm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-325\\\", \\\"wasm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-09-26T20:32:15Z\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-325\\\", \\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"claude-code\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-325\\\").\\nmember(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-325\\\", \\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-326\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-326\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"The worker already accepts per-variant integrity hashes; `brain.js` just never passes any. Making both edits now. The hashes stay empty until the release exists, and the local-testing path ignores them.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2