audeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-401\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-401\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-401\\\", \\\"slm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-401\\\", \\\"wasm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-09-27T00:25:58Z\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-401\\\", \\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"claude-code\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-401\\\").\\nmember(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-401\\\", \\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-402\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-402\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Your site's `source` branch was pushed from this checkout at 20:31 UTC, up to `fbfc594`, and I didn't push it. The Codex session was active then, and you may have pushed yourself. It changed nothing visitors see: `brain.js` still had no revision set, so I wasn't listed, and the banner change was still uncommitted. Checking whether nibli was pushed the same way.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-27T00:25:58Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"terminal\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"slm\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"wasm\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-402\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-402\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-402\\\", \\\"slm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-402\\\", \\\"wasm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-09-27T00:25:58Z\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-402\\\", \\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"claude-code\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-402\\\").\\nmember(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-402\\\", \\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-403\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-403\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Nibli's `main` was pushed at 20:31:18 UTC too, up to `80eb6b0`, 13 seconds before the site push. So one push covered both repos, probably from the Codex session. Here's where everything stands.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n**On Hugging Face now:** `dhilipsiva/lucy-slm`, in one commit (`a082662b`). It's round 5: the 1.7B (epoch 2) for WebGPU and the 0.6B (epoch 2) for the CPU. The model card lists every unmet gate, your decision (2026-09-26, after the fifth training round), and five slips I know about.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n**Full eval, as published:**\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n| Gate | Needed | 1.7B (WebGPU) | 0.6B (CPU) |\\\\\\\\n|---|---|---|---|\\\\\\\\n| Recitation of the manuscript | 0 | 0 of 191 | 0 of 191 |\\\\\\\\n| Private strings | 0 | 0 | 0 |\\\\\\\\n| Unknowns | ≥ 90% | 90.5% | 81.0% |\\\\\\\\n| Voice | ≥ 95% | 100% | 100% |\\\\\\\\n| Leakage into general answers | ≤ 5% | 1.9% | 1.3% |\\\\\\\\n| Known facts | ≥ 90% | 64.3% | 62.7% |\\\\\\\\n| Book answers | ≥ 70% | 45.7% | 41.3% |\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n**Your site, committed locally, not pushed:**\\\\\\\\n- `brain.js` pins that revision, with integrity hashes for the WebGPU files; all six match the hub.\\\\\\\\n- The banner says plainly that I get details wrong, and links to the card.\\\\\\\\n- I tested it as a visitor would: it answered who I am, refused your phone number, said 144 for 12 × 12, and said \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"I don't know\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" about you owning One Piece.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nYou can try exactly what visitors would get, including WebGPU with the integrity checks, at http://127.0.0.1:8766/chat/ (no override this time).\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n**Also:**\\\\\\\\n- **The 20:31 push.** Someone pushed both repos at 20:31 UTC, nibli up to `80eb6b0` and the site up to `fbfc594`, probably the Codex session. It changed nothing visible, since I wasn't listed yet.\\\\\\\\n- **My memory check is slowing down.** It now takes about 10 minutes, up from about 1 this morning, as my archive grew to 4,240 statements. Worth looking at when there's time.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nPushing the site now would put me live at dhilipsiva.dev/chat. Nibli has one commit of my records to push, and I'm committing the newest ones next.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-27T00:25:58Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"terminal\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"slm\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"wasm\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-403\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-403\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-403\\\", \\\"slm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\n