\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Codex\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"The `reboot-to-windows` command is already installed. I’m adding a “Reboot to Windows” action to the text login screen, with permission to run before you log in.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-10-18T18:09:20Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"dhilipsiva-desktop\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"codex\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"commentary\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"nixos\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"windows\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-3\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Codex\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-3\\\", \\\"nixos\\\", Conversation, \\\"Codex\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-3\\\", \\\"windows\\\", Conversation, \\\"Codex\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-10-18T18:09:20Z\\\", \\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-3\\\", \\\"dhilipsiva-desktop\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"codex\\\", \\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-3\\\").\\nmember(\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-3\\\", \\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-4\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Codex\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"I’ll add an **F11 Reboot to Windows** button that opens the power menu with Windows selected; Enter will confirm it. The login screen will get permission to run only that fixed reboot command.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-10-18T18:09:20Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"dhilipsiva-desktop\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"codex\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"c