-5\\\", \\\"windows\\\", Conversation, \\\"Codex\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-10-18T18:09:20Z\\\", \\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-5\\\", \\\"dhilipsiva-desktop\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"codex\\\", \\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-5\\\").\\nmember(\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-5\\\", \\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-6\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-6\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Codex\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"The patched greeter builds successfully. Configuration checks also confirm that the Windows button is desktop-only and sudo remains restricted to wheel users. The remaining checks are testing the login screen’s permission to run the helper before login.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-10-18T18:09:20Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"dhilipsiva-desktop\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"codex\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"commentary\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"nixos\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"windows\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-6\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Codex\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-6\\\", \\\"nixos\\\", Conversation, \\\"Codex\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-6\\\", \\\"windows\\\", Conversation, \\\"Codex\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-10-18T18:09:20Z\\\", \\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-6\\\", \\\"dhilipsiva-desktop\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"codex\\\", \\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-6\\\").\\nmember(\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-6\\\", \\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-7\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-7\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Codex\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"The VM exposed a pre-login issue: `pkexec` rejects the greeter’s inherited `nologin` shell. I’ve adjusted the button command to clear that variable and strengthened the test to require proof that the helper actually ran.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-10-18T18:09:20Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"dhilipsiva-desktop\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"codex\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"commentary\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"nixos\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"windows\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-7\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Codex\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-7\\\", \\\"nixos\\\", Conversation, \\\"Codex\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-7\\\", \\\"windows\\\", Conversation, \\\"Codex\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-10-18T18:09:20Z\\\", \\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-7\\\", \\\"dhilipsiva-desktop\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"codex\\\", \\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-7\\\").\\nmember(\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-7\\\", \\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-8\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-8\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Codex\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"The VM now confirms that F11 selects Windows, Escape cancels, and Enter runs the helper as root without a password prompt. All flake checks pass. I’m finishing the final system builds; testing has not rebooted or changed the running desktop.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-10-18T18:09:20Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"dhilipsiva-desktop\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"codex\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"commentary\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"nixos\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"windows\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-8\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Codex\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-8\\\", \\\"nixos\\\", Conversation, \\\"Codex\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-8\\\", \\\"windows\\\", Conversation, \\\"Codex\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-10-18T18:09:20Z\\\", \\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-8\\\", \\\"dhilipsiva-desktop\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"codex\\\", \\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-8\\\").\\nmember(\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-8\\\", \\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-9\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-9\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Codex\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Implemented in the [desktop configuration](/home/dhilipsiva/projects/dhilipsiva/NixOS/hosts/desktop/windows.nix).\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n- **Command:** `reboot-to-windows` — already installed.\\\\\\\\n- **Login button:** **F11 Reboot to Windows**, then **Enter** to confirm or **Esc** to cancel. Works before login.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nFormatting, flake checks, VM login tests, and all-host builds passed.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nThe button isn’t live yet: these changes still need publication, staging through `nixosctl stage --host desktop`, and a manual reboot.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-10-18T18:09:20Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"dhilipsiva-desktop\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"codex\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"final\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"nixos\\\\\\\