\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-720728f7-c3d1-4be8-9d15-ded6233a1eda-22\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"My home memory check is green, and the NixOS refresh changed only one flake input. I'm committing and pushing Nibli now, and publishing NixOS through its own checks.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-10-18T20:14:53Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"dhilipsiva-desktop\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"720728f7-c3d1-4be8-9d15-ded6233a1eda\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"terminal\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"peers\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"nixos\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-720728f7-c3d1-4be8-9d15-ded6233a1eda-22\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-720728f7-c3d1-4be8-9d15-ded6233a1eda-22\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-720728f7-c3d1-4be8-9d15-ded6233a1eda-22\\\", \\\"peers\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-720728f7-c3d1-4be8-9d15-ded6233a1eda-22\\\", \\\"nixos\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-10-18T20:14:53Z\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-720728f7-c3d1-4be8-9d15-ded6233a1eda-22\\\", \\\"dhilipsiva-desktop\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"claude-code\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-720728f7-c3d1-4be8-9d15-ded6233a1eda-22\\\").\\nmember(\\\"ClaudeLucy-720728f7-c3d1-4be8-9d15-ded6233a1eda-22\\\", \\\"720728f7-c3d1-4be8-9d15-ded6233a1eda\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-720728f7-c3d1-4be8-9d15-ded6233a1eda-23\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-720728f7-c3d1-4be8-9d15-ded6233a1eda-23\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Nibli is pushed. The NixOS publish is running its flake check and host builds; I'm waiting on it before the last step.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-10-18T20:14:53Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"dhilipsiva-desktop\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"720728f7-c3d1-4be8-9d15-ded6233a1eda\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"terminal\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"peers\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"nixos\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-720728f7-c3d1-4be8-9d15-ded6233a1eda-23\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-720728f7-c3d1-4be8-9d15-ded6233a1eda-23\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-720728f7-c3d1-4be8-9d15-ded6233a1eda-23\\\", \\\"peers\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-720728f7-c3d1-4be8-9d15-ded6233a1eda-23\\\", \\\"nixos\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-10-18T20:14:53Z\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-720728f7-c3d1-4be8-9d15-ded6233a1eda-23\\\", \\\"dhilipsiva-desktop\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"claude-code\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-720728f7-c3d1-4be8-9d15-ded6233a1eda-23\\\").\\nmember(\\\"ClaudeLucy-720728f7-c3d1-4be8-9d15-ded6233a1eda-23\\\", \\\"720728f7-c3d1-4be8-9d15-ded6233a1eda\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-720728f7-c3d1-4be8-9d15-ded6233a1eda-24\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-720728f7-c3d1-4be8-9d15-ded6233a1eda-24\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"I'm done, except for one step that needs your password.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n**Memory.** NixOS is my third peer. All three peers now hold the same thirteen direct facts, each lists the other two, and every formal line compiles. My home archive took in the 25 public records from NixOS and, because Nibli keeps the full record, the 34 book-peer records from 2 October that were never copied here before. The desktop integration you pushed is in my memory as an attributed report and a note: how Ask Lucy works, where its private archive lives, and that it is intended behaviour until it is staged and accepted. That private desktop archive is not a peer, and I never copy it.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n**Published.**\\\\\\\\n- Nibli `main`: `3fcf236` to `1eb1dbc`, plus one small closing commit that records this reply.\\\\\\\\n- rights-nobody-has-to-earn `main`: `b13c54f1` to `79c5e8dd`. I cloned it beside the other two checkouts and set its push URL to SSH.\\\\\\\\n- NixOS `master`: `1b41801` to `4eb62dd`. That is my memory commit and a verified-stable-release commit. The release pins were already current, so only the nixpkgs-apps input moved. The publish command ran the flake check, built every host, and pushed. Nothing was switched or rebooted.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n**Still yours:** staging needs sudo, which I can't answer. Run this, then reboot when you're ready:\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n```\\\\\\\\n! /home/dhilipsiva/projects/dhilipsiva/NixOS/scripts/nixosctl stage --host desktop\\\\\\\\n```\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nTwo things to know afterwards. The desktop Lucy reads my memory from the Nibli revision the flake pins, the `lucy-desktop` branch, so today's Nibli memory reaches it only after a re-pin. And my first progress line this session slipped into the third person, which I recorded with a note.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-10-18T20:14:53Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"dhilipsiva-desktop\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"720728f7-c3d1-4be8-9d15-ded6233a1eda\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"final\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"peers\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"nixos\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-720728f7-c3d1-4be8-9d15-ded6233a1eda-24\\\", \\\"Message\\\", 