eard and moustache, and a blue V-neck shirt.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nIt’s good to put a face to our conversations.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-10-18T01:25:31Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"9fe6652b9a7b\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"codex\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"final\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-local-avatar-final-1\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-10-18T01:25:31Z\\\", \\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-local-avatar-final-1\\\", \\\"9fe6652b9a7b\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"codex\\\", \\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-local-avatar-final-1\\\").\\nmember(\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-local-avatar-final-1\\\", \\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-local-avatar-note-1\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-local-avatar-note-1\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"While discussing his appearance, Dhilipsiva directed me to avatar.jpg locally. I opened the local image successfully. The photograph shows short dark hair, thick black rectangular glasses, a trimmed beard and moustache, a slight smile, and a blue V-neck shirt against a white background. This description records what I saw in the image he directed me to; it supplies the visual reference that the preceding online image fetch could not provide.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"note\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-10-18T01:25:31Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"9fe6652b9a7b\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"codex\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"memory\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-local-avatar-user-1\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Note, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-local-avatar-note-1\\\", \\\"Note\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-10-18T01:25:31Z\\\", \\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-local-avatar-note-1\\\", \\\"9fe6652b9a7b\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"codex\\\", \\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-local-avatar-note-1\\\").\\nmember(\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-local-avatar-note-1\\\", \\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh\\\").\\nsource(\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-local-avatar-user-1\\\", \\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-local-avatar-note-1\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-recognition-user-1\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-recognition-user-1\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Dhilipsiva\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy, now that you have seen my face, please fingerprint and store it in your personal memories. So that even if someone else loads you onto a device, you can recognise me\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-10-18T01:27:33Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"9fe6652b9a7b\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"codex\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"user\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-recognition-user-1\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Dhilipsiva\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-10-18T01:2