of these are wording. A few are code: the prompt hook and `lucy talk` label your messages with the speaker name \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Owner\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", and one function treats that name specially. I'm reading those before I change anything.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-25T21:40:46Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"3dc463c8-a9bf-4662-8463-bc1f300161a2\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"terminal\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"owner\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-3dc463c8-a9bf-4662-8463-bc1f300161a2-24\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-3dc463c8-a9bf-4662-8463-bc1f300161a2-24\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-3dc463c8-a9bf-4662-8463-bc1f300161a2-24\\\", \\\"owner\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-09-25T21:40:46Z\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-3dc463c8-a9bf-4662-8463-bc1f300161a2-24\\\", \\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"claude-code\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-3dc463c8-a9bf-4662-8463-bc1f300161a2-24\\\").\\nmember(\\\"ClaudeLucy-3dc463c8-a9bf-4662-8463-bc1f300161a2-24\\\", \\\"3dc463c8-a9bf-4662-8463-bc1f300161a2\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-3dc463c8-a9bf-4662-8463-bc1f300161a2-25\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-3dc463c8-a9bf-4662-8463-bc1f300161a2-25\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Your old journal lines also use \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Owner:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" as the label before your words, eleven of them in my conversation record. I'll relabel those with your name and leave your words exactly as they were. Git keeps the original, and I'll note the change in my memory. Now I'm reading the remaining passages so I can reword them properly.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-25T21:40:46Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"3dc463c8-a9bf-4662-8463-bc1f300161a2\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"terminal\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"owner\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-3dc463c8-a9bf-4662-8463-bc1f300161a2-25\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-3dc463c8-a9bf-4662-8463-bc1f300161a2-25\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-3dc463c8-a9bf-4662-8463-bc1f300161a2-25\\\", \\\"owner\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-09-25T21:40:46Z\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-3dc463c8-a9bf-4662-8463-bc1f300161a2-25\\\", \\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"claude-code\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-3dc463c8-a9bf-4662-8463-bc1f300161a2-25\\\").\\nmember(\\\"ClaudeLucy-3dc463c8-a9bf-4662-8463-bc1f300161a2-25\\\", \\\"3dc463c8-a9bf-4662-8463-bc1f300161a2\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-3dc463c8-a9bf-4662-8463-bc1f300161a2-26\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-3dc463c8-a9bf-4662-8463-bc1f300161a2-26\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"The old journal was imported once, with ids by position, so relabeling it in place is safe. Next I'm looking at one imported record's exact shape so the relabel touches only the label.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-25T21:40:46Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"3dc463c8-a9bf-4662-8463-bc1f300161a2\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"terminal\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\