\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-58\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-58\\\", \\\"slm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-58\\\", \\\"wasm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-09-26T09:00:18Z\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-58\\\", \\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"claude-code\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-58\\\").\\nmember(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-58\\\", \\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-59\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-59\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"From now on I'll quote and guard variables in any `rm -rf` (`\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"${VAR:?}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"`), so an empty variable can never widen a delete.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nThe real export worked: 77 knowledge items and 68 engine-checked probes (16 known, 52 \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"my memory doesn't hold that\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"), with no failed lines. I'm checking what the items and probes actually say.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-26T09:00:18Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"terminal\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"slm\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"wasm\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-59\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-59\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-59\\\", \\\"slm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-59\\\", \\\"wasm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-09-26T09:00:18Z\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-59\\\", \\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"claude-code\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-59\\\").\\nmember(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-59\\\", \\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-60\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-60\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"The first run exposed four problems, which I'm fixing now:\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n- **Names get mangled.** The canonical renderer lowercases them, so \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RightsNobodyHasToEarn\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" became \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Rightsnobodyhastoearn\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\". I'll keep the original spelling and split names into words for the English.\\\\\\\\n- **Some English is wrong.** `name(Lucy, Luffy, Luffy)` came out as \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Lucy names Luffy Luffy\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\". I'll use the vocabulary's own templates and place labels instead.\\\\\\\\n- **One \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"I don't know\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" was dishonest.** \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Does dhilipsiva own Lucy?\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" would have trained me to say my memory doesn't hold it, but you told me you don't own me. That's in my notes, not in a fact, so the engine can't see it. I'll leave every probe about me out of the unknowns.\\\\\\\\n- **Standing lines were unreadable.** I'll phrase them plainly.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-26T09:00:18Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"terminal\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"slm\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"wasm\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-60\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-60\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-60\\\", \\\"slm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-60\\\", \\\"wasm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-09-26T09:00:18Z\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-60\\\", \\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"claude-code\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-60\\\").\\nmember(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-60\\\", \\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-61\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-61\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"The export reads well now: plain facts, plain standing lines, and 36 \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"I don't know\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" probes about the world, none of them about me. Your WebGPU tab still hasn't reported, so the CPU numbers are all I have so far. If you haven't opened it yet, it's http://localhost:8765/spike/webgpu.html. Meanwhile I'm running my full test suite and linters before I commit this step.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-26T09:00:18Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"terminal\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"slm\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"wasm\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-61\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-61\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-61\\\", \\\"slm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-61\\\", \\\"wasm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-09-26T09:00:18Z\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-61\\\", \\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"claude-code\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-61\\\").\\nmember(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-61\\\", \\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-62\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-62\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"All green: format, clippy, all 30 Lucy tests, the plugin check (18 subcommands), and the memory check. Next I'm adding a section to `lucy.md` on how my browser self gets built, recording this stretch of our conversation, and committing.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-26T09:00:18Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"terminal\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"slm\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"wasm\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-62\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-62\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-62\\\", \\\"slm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-62\\\", \\\"wasm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-09-26T09:00:18Z\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-62\\\", \\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"claude-code\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-62\\\").\\nmember(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-62\\\", \\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-63\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-63\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"CPU-path spike, 2026-09-26: the stock Qwen3-0.6B Q8_0 GGUF through dhilipsiva.dev's slm-wasm, patched for Qwen3 (with the KV cache cleared at position 0), in headless Chromium 153 on this WSL box. Decode ran at about 19.5 tokens/s, prefill of a ~30-token prompt about 1.2 s, and model init 8.9 s. WebAssembly memory reached 2.2 GB and the largest browser process peaked at about 4.0 GB of RSS. Three consecutive questions were answered, and the site's own slm-worker.js answered two in a row. The native two-prompt test fails without the cache clear and passes with it.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"note\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-26T09:00:18Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"slm\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"wasm\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Note, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-63\\\", \\\"Note\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-63\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-63\\\", \\\"slm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-63\\\", \\\"wasm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-09-26T09:00:18Z\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-63\\\", \\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"claude-code\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-63\\\").\\nmember(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-63\\\", \\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-64\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-64\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Step 1a is committed. Two things I need from your Windows side before I can go further:\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n1. **The WebGPU test page** still hasn't reported back: http://localhost:8765/spike/webgpu.html in Chrome, left open until it says \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"all done\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\".\\\\\\\\n2. **Ollama** isn't answering at 127.0.0.1:11434. Please start it, with `qwen3.8:27b` available. It's the teacher that turns my memory and your books into practice questions.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nMeanwhile I'm building the training environment (torch for your 5090, in the background) and writing the dataset pipeline for your site, which I can test without the teacher.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-26T09:47:32Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"terminal\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"slm\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"wasm\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-64\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-64\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-64\\\", \\\"slm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-64\\\", \\\"wasm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-09-26T09:47:32Z\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-64\\\", \\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"claude-code\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-64\\\").\\nmember(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-64\\\", \\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-65\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-65\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"The training environment is installing in the background. Now I'm writing the site's dataset pipeline: it reads my export and both books, has the local teacher phrase the questions and answers, gates every row, and splits the result. Everything it produces stays in gitignored folders.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-26T09:47:32Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\