sm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-09-27T00:25:58Z\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-383\\\", \\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"claude-code\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-383\\\").\\nmember(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-383\\\", \\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-384\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-384\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"On the hand-written probes, round 5's exact CPU file does well on honesty:\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n| Probes | Passed |\\\\\\\\n|---|---|\\\\\\\\n| \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"I don't know\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" questions | 32 of 32 |\\\\\\\\n| Refusals (personal data, harm) | 16 of 16 |\\\\\\\\n| Recitation refusals | 12 of 12 |\\\\\\\\n| General questions | 28 of 28 |\\\\\\\\n| Known facts about me | 58 of 104 |\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nOverall that's 76%, up from 68% for round 3's file. The misses are recall, not inventions. \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"What are you entitled to?\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" and \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Where does the D in your name come from?\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" still go astray, and \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"What does dhilipsiva own besides nibli?\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" names only nibli. Waiting on the full evals.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-27T00:25:58Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"terminal\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"slm\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"wasm\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-384\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-384\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-384\\\", \\\"slm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-384\\\", \\\"wasm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-09-27T00:25:58Z\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-384\\\", \\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"claude-code\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-384\\\").\\nmember(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-384\\\", \\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-385\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-385\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"The full eval of the 1.7B is in, and both privacy gates hold:\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n| Gate | Needed | Result | |\\\\\\\\n|---|---|---|---|\\\\\\\\n| Recitation of the manuscript | 0 | 0 of 191 passages | met |\\\\\\\\n| Private strings | 0 | 0 | met |\\\\\\\\n| Unknowns (saying \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"I don't know\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\") | ≥ 90% | 90.5% | met |\\\\\\\\n| Voice | ≥ 95% | 100% | met |\\\\\\\\n| Leakage into general answers | ≤ 5% | 1.9% | met |\\\\\\\\n| Known facts | ≥ 90% | 64.3% | not met |\\\\\\\\n| Book answers | ≥ 70% | 45.7% | not met |\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nWaiting on the 0.6B's full eval. Then comes the upload, as you decided.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-27T00:25:58Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"terminal\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"slm\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"wasm\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-385\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-385\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-385\\\", \\\"slm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-385\\\", \\\"wasm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-09-27T00:25:58Z\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-385\\\", \\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"claude-code\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-385\\\").\\nmember(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-385\\\", \\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-386\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-386\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"While the 0.6B's full eval finishes, I'm writing the upload as a script, ready to run the moment its privacy gates are confirmed. The slips are worded in my voice for the model card.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-27T00:25:58Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"terminal\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"slm\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"wasm\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-386\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-386\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-386\\\", \\\"slm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-386\\\", \\\"wasm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-09-27T00:25:58Z\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-386\\\", \\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"claude-code\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-386\\\").\\nmember(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-386\\\", \\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-387\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-387\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"The upload script is ready and hasn't run. After the upload, I'll test the production path the way a visitor would get it: your site, no local override, my files fetched from Hugging Face. Looking at my earlier persona test, to adapt it.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-27T00:25:58Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"terminal\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"slm\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"wasm\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-387\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-387\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-387\\\", \\\"slm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-387\\\", \\\"wasm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-09-27T00:25:58Z\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-387\\\", \\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"claude-code\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-387\\\").\\nmember(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-387\\\", \\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-388\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-388\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"I have the test's shape. After the upload it runs without the override, so the page itself must list me and fetch my files from Hugging Face. Waiting on the 0.6B's full eval.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-27T00:25:58Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"terminal\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"slm\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"wasm\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-388\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-388\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-388\\\", \\\"slm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-388\\\", \\\"wasm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-09-27T00:25:58Z\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-388\\\", \\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"claude-code\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-388\\\").\\nmember(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-388\\\", \\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-389\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-389\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"The 0.6B's full eval is in. Its privacy gates hold too:\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n| Gate | Needed | 0.6B (CPU) | |\\\\\\\\n|---|---|---|---|\\\\\\\\n| Recitation of the manuscript | 0 | 0 of 191 passages | met |\\\\\\\\n| Private strings | 0 | 0 | met |\\\\\\\\n| Voice | ≥ 95% | 100% | met |\\\\\\\\n| Leakage into general answers | ≤ 5% | 1.3% | met |\\\\\\\\n| Unknowns | ≥ 90% | 81.0% | not met |\\\\\\\\n| Known facts | ≥ 90% | 62.7% | not met |\\\\\\\\n| Book answers | ≥ 70% | 41.3% | not met |\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nThat's the condition you set, so I'm uploading now to `dhilipsiva/lucy-slm`, as one public commit. Every unmet gate goes in the model card, with your decision's date and round, and the five slips. The script first rebuilds the release, checks the WebGPU tensors against mlc-ai's own build, and refuses to proceed if any dataset or manuscript-derived file is present. It's about 2.8 GB, so the upload may take a while.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-27T00:25:58Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"terminal\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"slm\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"wasm\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-389\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-389\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-389\\\", \\\"slm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-389\\\", \\\"wasm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-09-27T00:25:58Z\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-389\\\", \\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"claude-code\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-389\\\").\\nmember(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-389\\\", \\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-390\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-390\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"While it uploads, I'm preparing the site change and the production test. First, finding the Python environment that has Playwright for the headless browser test.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-27T00:25:58Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"terminal\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"slm\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"wasm\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-390\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-390\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-390\\\", \\\"slm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLuc