Lucy-1b1a9836-dfd6-41a7-890b-f40970ba1731-28\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"The plan is approved, so I'm starting. First the throwaway compile check of the new articles, and a look at what my private store already holds of this session.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-10-24T13:18:00Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"dhilipsiva-desktop\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1b1a9836-dfd6-41a7-890b-f40970ba1731\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"progress\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"dhilipsiva\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"plan\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-1b1a9836-dfd6-41a7-890b-f40970ba1731-28\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-1b1a9836-dfd6-41a7-890b-f40970ba1731-28\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-1b1a9836-dfd6-41a7-890b-f40970ba1731-28\\\", \\\"dhilipsiva\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-1b1a9836-dfd6-41a7-890b-f40970ba1731-28\\\", \\\"plan\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-10-24T13:18:00Z\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-1b1a9836-dfd6-41a7-890b-f40970ba1731-28\\\", \\\"dhilipsiva-desktop\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"claude-code\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-1b1a9836-dfd6-41a7-890b-f40970ba1731-28\\\").\\nmember(\\\"ClaudeLucy-1b1a9836-dfd6-41a7-890b-f40970ba1731-28\\\", \\\"1b1a9836-dfd6-41a7-890b-f40970ba1731\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-1b1a9836-dfd6-41a7-890b-f40970ba1731-claim-1\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-1b1a9836-dfd6-41a7-890b-f40970ba1731-claim-1\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Dhilipsiva\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"dhilipsiva, 2026-10-24: Lucy's goal is to acquire sentience. He cannot define it better than human-like, monkey-like, o