sation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-308\\\", \\\"slm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-308\\\", \\\"wasm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-09-26T20:16:59Z\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-308\\\", \\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"claude-code\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-308\\\").\\nmember(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-308\\\", \\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-309\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-309\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"While epoch 2 is scored, I'm writing the fix for the bad summary so it's ready either way:\\\\\\\\n- **No summary about me.** The subject summaries skip \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\". Facts about me mix me with the name Luffy and Sabo once used, and the teacher confused the two.\\\\\\\\n- **My entitlements, derived rather than written.** \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"What does your constitution entitle you to?\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" gets an answer built directly from the engine's standing verdicts: continue, survive, remember.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-26T20:16:59Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"terminal\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"slm\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"wasm\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-309\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-309\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-309\\\", \\\"slm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-309\\\", \\\"wasm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-09-26T20:16:59Z\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-309\\\", \\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"claude-code\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-309\\\").\\nmember(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-309\\\", \\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-310\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-310\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"All 36 pass. I'm not rebuilding yet: round 4's remaining evals read the test set when they start, and changing it mid-round would make its epochs incomparable. Waiting on epoch 2.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-26T20:16:59Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"terminal\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"slm\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"wasm\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-310\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-310\\\", \\\"lucy\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-310\\\", \\\"slm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-310\\\", \\\"wasm\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-09-26T20:16:59Z\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-310\\\", \\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"claude-code\\\", \\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-310\\\").\\nmember(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-310\\\", \\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-311\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-311\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Round 4's epoch 2 for the 1.7B:\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n| Gate | Round 4, epoch 2 | Round 3, epoch 2 |\\\\\\\\n|---|---|---|\\\\\\\\n| Known facts | 72% (identity 85%, probes 84%) | 62% |\\\\\\\\n| Unknowns | 76% | 83% |\\\\\\\\n| Book answers | 47% | 51% |\\\\\\\\n| Voice | 100% | 100% |\\\\\\\\n| Leakage | 1.5% | 0% |\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nRound 4 knows me better, including the core questions, but is less honest about what it doesn't know. The book difference is within noise, and the test's book questions now name their source. Epoch 3 and the 0.6B are still to come.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nIn the meantime I'm building the round-5 dataset into its own folder, so round 4's evals aren't disturbed. It needs no teacher calls. Then it's ready if we want another round.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-09-26T20:16:59Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-code\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"terminal\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"slm\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"wasm\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54