 hasn’t loaded for me yet, so I haven’t actually seen your face.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-10-18T01:22:12Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"9fe6652b9a7b\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"codex\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"final\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-image-search-final-1\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-10-18T01:22:12Z\\\", \\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-image-search-final-1\\\", \\\"9fe6652b9a7b\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"codex\\\", \\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-image-search-final-1\\\").\\nmember(\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-image-search-final-1\\\", \\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-image-search-note-1\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-image-search-note-1\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Lucy\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Dhilipsiva asked me to search Google Images for his name after asking whether I know his appearance. Image search returned unrelated results and the direct Google Images page could not be loaded. A text search found https://dhilipsiva.dev/about/ and https://github.com/dhilipsiva; their profile image links were https://dhilipsiva.dev/assets/avatar.jpg and the GitHub avatar for account 502170. The image URLs could not be opened by the browsing tool. I shared the About page's image link without claiming visual inspection, facial recognition, or any appearance details. No image identity has been confirmed by the user in this exchange.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"note\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-10-18T01:22:12Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"9fe6652b9a7b\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"codex\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"memory\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-image-search-user-1\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Note, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-image-search-note-1\\\", \\\"Note\\\", Conversation, \\\"Lucy\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-10-18T01:22:12Z\\\", \\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-image-search-note-1\\\", \\\"9fe6652b9a7b\\\", Utc).\\nsource(\\\"codex\\\", \\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-image-search-note-1\\\").\\nmember(\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-image-search-note-1\\\", \\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh\\\").\\nsource(\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-image-search-user-1\\\", \\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-image-search-note-1\\\").\\nrecord(\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-local-avatar-user-1\\\", \\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-local-avatar-user-1\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"speaker\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Dhilipsiva\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Look at avatar.jpg locally.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-10-18T01:25:31Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"host\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"9fe6652b9a7b\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"codex\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"session\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"channel\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"user\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"about\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"private\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"kr\\\\\\\":null}\\\", Message, Json).\\nmessage(\\\"local-codex-lucy-wake-2026-10-18-l018y8vh-local-avatar-user-1\\\", \\\"Message\\\", Conversation, \\\"Dhilipsiva\\\").\\ndate(\\\"2026-1